               role="field"
               xml:id="org.osgi.framework.startlevel.dto.FrameworkStartLevelDTO.initialBundleStartLevel">
         <title>public int initialBundleStartLevel</title>
         <para>
The initial start level value that is assigned to a bundle when it is
 first installed.
